            *   `[^<>()[\]\\.,;:\s@"]+`: Matches one or more characters that are NOT angle brackets, parentheses, square brackets, backslash, dot, comma, semicolon, colon, whitespace, or at symbol, or double quote.
            *   `(\.[^<>()[\]\\.,;:\s@"]+)*`: Allows for dots followed by more valid characters, preventing consecutive dots and dots at the start/end of segments.
            *   `(".+")`: Handles quoted local parts, allowing almost any character within double quotes.
