        *   The domain name validation `[a-zA-Z0-9](?:[a-zA-Z0-9-]{0,61}[a-zA-Z0-9])?` for domain labels ensures they start and end with alphanumeric characters and allows hyphens in between, with a length limit of 63 characters per label. The overall domain structure `([a-zA-Z0-9](?:[a-zA-Z0-9-]{0,61}[a-zA-Z0-9])?\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}` ensures at least two labels and a TLD of at least two letters.

